+add rax, strict byte 4
+add rax, dword 4
+add rax, strict dword 4
+add rax, 400
+add rax, strict 400
+add rax, byte 400		; generates warning
+add rax, strict byte 400	; generates warning
+add rax, dword 400
+add rax, strict dword 400
+
+add rbx, 4
